{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_06731ae1bf9be4a80775b4297bb526d6fb1627e95041a92d7607ce640c091bd7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"codehamr/codehamr@8ad8eae6cc57 snapshot 3adff9ea9eb023a4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_568c423ce3247438d4230e4583100c74cddb0342abb85580acd706777e13ef3e"],"source_ids":["src_8db6fa9a716e500ca7ac8c89403b0dc6"],"text":"codehamr is described as a minimal coding agent for the terminal, built for local LLMs and also able to run against OpenAI-compatible endpoints.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1ac704a82a26b8e0a4489f382f603a83766291ab2e253241b2d269c3a8642a83","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"codehamr/codehamr@8ad8eae6cc57 snapshot 3adff9ea9eb023a4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b016e98353d29424a736f09f004cbfb8ca175896436e6c0d306872ae8ed2cbe5"],"source_ids":["src_8db6fa9a716e500ca7ac8c89403b0dc6"],"text":"Because Ollama's /v1 endpoint reports no context-window header, codehamr packs to the configured context_size; if the server honors less, it silently front-truncates and the agent can lose its system prompt and earlier tool results mid-task with no error.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2175083c3dcb190b435d97a079ae4d1c8d53512ea22eeb5b7e106169d2c8cc18","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"codehamr/codehamr@8ad8eae6cc57 snapshot 3adff9ea9eb023a4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_068ca43f83024cbd102d531968856a5da15a8e3b80f2727d1cb803a5587ea2c9"],"source_ids":["src_8db6fa9a716e500ca7ac8c89403b0dc6"],"text":"The /models command lists configured model profiles, and /models <name> switches the active profile.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4b7b754c0f0e3292dda630170bf04de8fa048a7ad9ce165ac5a154bc8a52908c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"codehamr/codehamr@8ad8eae6cc57 snapshot 3adff9ea9eb023a4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_47f0ddd87103ca5366a44da32b692862d81a8b16ae0a156bcba18a29d2dc857f","slc_9dd7942eefe3d8d8432a8bf8e2319709b4563be26b047814c9695daca545b157"],"source_ids":["src_8db6fa9a716e500ca7ac8c89403b0dc6"],"text":"Self-verification (running tests, compiling, loading the page) is instilled by the system prompt as a habit rather than a blocking gate; when a check cannot run, the agent reports 'unverified:' instead of pretending success.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_684300096fdef39891470e9b9b7cbcd1718f7cd06b8b0b6f8716605eda7c3eb8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"codehamr/codehamr@8ad8eae6cc57 snapshot 3adff9ea9eb023a4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1b80d6d70de8ac0a994bfbb2dc0b0a317ab40b1e2d0092fbf45bf700e0c88596"],"source_ids":["src_8db6fa9a716e500ca7ac8c89403b0dc6"],"text":"The README warns that the agent runs model-generated shell commands with full filesystem access and recommends running it inside sandboxes such as devcontainers or isolated VMs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6d65741c07a4ebb1b146c5b58bde38272e132c77810c32373f05e176f6784b9f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"codehamr/codehamr@8ad8eae6cc57 snapshot 3adff9ea9eb023a4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_08b71e3fa19fe45d82c95e4b157f3c6ef2b0186ca651c56e7e48da0ff4863dc3"],"source_ids":["src_8db6fa9a716e500ca7ac8c89403b0dc6"],"text":"On Windows the bash tool requires a POSIX shell (/bin/sh), so the agent should be run inside WSL2 or a devcontainer rather than from a bare cmd/PowerShell host.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_859bdae9fd107b26ea877b737486d593b395bcf705a276877fdb214df15d0010","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"codehamr/codehamr@8ad8eae6cc57 snapshot 3adff9ea9eb023a4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2c0f1ae4a7e2da972c8b3abc80a20b0e82d552b9bc57bc9dac9e63687d6250ec"],"source_ids":["src_8db6fa9a716e500ca7ac8c89403b0dc6"],"text":"On first run codehamr seeds .codehamr/config.yaml with a local profile (Ollama, vLLM, LM-Studio) and a hamrpass profile; the system prompt is embedded in the binary, not stored on disk.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_975914a3a92def0d0398365969d5760cb849511bb6ab981071432ed73fa3c5ba","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"codehamr/codehamr@8ad8eae6cc57 snapshot 3adff9ea9eb023a4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9dd7942eefe3d8d8432a8bf8e2319709b4563be26b047814c9695daca545b157"],"source_ids":["src_8db6fa9a716e500ca7ac8c89403b0dc6"],"text":"The agent runs a single plain loop: it calls tools until the work is done, then replies, rather than using a more elaborate orchestration scheme.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b4d3375c1a8ab72fe4dc67d439b4a846c9c88e7a60c546a2603234128347dc3e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"codehamr/codehamr@8ad8eae6cc57 snapshot 3adff9ea9eb023a4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9dd7942eefe3d8d8432a8bf8e2319709b4563be26b047814c9695daca545b157"],"source_ids":["src_8db6fa9a716e500ca7ac8c89403b0dc6"],"text":"The agent works with four tools — bash, read_file, write_file, and edit_file — investigating the project directly rather than guessing.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cbf01476c59872491735309e1c80dc42314bd89480d130ddac832fea7d976d21","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"codehamr/codehamr@8ad8eae6cc57 snapshot 3adff9ea9eb023a4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3976d6dd4f8d972dba600aea69e952b86c5f92c85916417c317b6ed1aa525718","slc_44f98627139cb851a0d032a484eda9f6efdc7e158e3aee2aa537f559170ce7f9"],"source_ids":["src_8db6fa9a716e500ca7ac8c89403b0dc6"],"text":"Configuration supports OpenAI-compatible endpoints; the example config defines local, openai, and hamrpass profiles with llm and url fields, and the local and openai profiles also carry key and context_size fields.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e76eaafdbf6155822d2ddf78e24f24e3c3e3fad2ccae972dc11d971717dc6055","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"codehamr/codehamr@8ad8eae6cc57 snapshot 3adff9ea9eb023a4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_136054d061bcb919d98e838f6d155c2e17605682d68b051964d0c93362fa7434","slc_1a7bdbe76bb2106234b640c76dbea26cd2c11dea73466178cd76a128be11a926","slc_b36204186afef20fa660ef20f4fa2f1775cafdef1f886af9ca79736cec0754d2","slc_ec8c50cd38570a7606434bfa5c1769fdb70bd2bd553270026f990038d608537d"],"source_ids":["src_8db6fa9a716e500ca7ac8c89403b0dc6"],"text":"The project is MIT licensed and open source; HamrPass, a hosted endpoint with tuned model defaults, is optional and will only be built if waitlist demand appears.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","created_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f44b5b0405ec7c5b12c29e4b696279af46c3380db6d592b93f5372b7d7f49a5c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"codehamr/codehamr@8ad8eae6cc57 snapshot 3adff9ea9eb023a4","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_41ae4455376efc037d4e064e3811999eeffafd8928fcf9906549c9a1624db19d"],"source_ids":["src_8db6fa9a716e500ca7ac8c89403b0dc6"],"text":"The design deliberately favors simplicity: three slash commands, one embedded system prompt, and no router, sub-agents, skill system, or MCP.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:43:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2ac18e71bbde44e7aa1191650fd2bed7"}
